{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09487","headline":"汉武帝杂歌三首 二 · 韦应物","name":"汉武帝杂歌三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金茎孤峙兮凌紫烟，汉宫美人望杳然。\n通天台上月初出，承露盘中珠正圆。\n珠可饮，寿可永，武皇南面曙欲分。\n从空下来玉杯冷，世间彩翠亦作囊。\n八月一日仙人方，仙方称上药。\n静者服之常绰约，柏梁沈饮自伤神，犹闻驻颜七十春。\n乃知甘醲皆是腐肠物，独有淡泊之水能益人。\n千载金盘竟何处，当时铸金恐不固。\n蔓草生来春复秋，碧天何言空坠露。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}